@page "/privacy"

<main class="privacy-shell">
    <section class="privacy-card">
        <div class="privacy-kicker">WordsTrainer</div>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="privacy-updated">Last updated: June 8, 2026</p>

        <p>
            WordsTrainer is a vocabulary training app. This policy explains what information
            the app uses and why.
        </p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
            We collect the email address you use to create and access your account. We also store
            your selected native language, target language, language level, training progress,
            answers, review schedule, and password reset tokens.
        </p>

        <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
        <p>
            We use this information to sign you in, provide vocabulary exercises, track learning
            progress, schedule reviews, localize the interface, send password reset emails, and
            diagnose technical issues.
        </p>

        <h2>Backend And Email Services</h2>
        <p>
            The app communicates with the WordsTrainer backend API hosted on Railway. Password
            reset emails are sent through Brevo. We do not sell personal information.
        </p>

        <h2>Notifications</h2>
        <p>
            If notifications are enabled, the Android app can show a daily reminder to continue
            training. Notification scheduling is used only for learning reminders.
        </p>

        <h2>Error Logs</h2>
        <p>
            Server errors may be logged with technical details such as request path, trace id,
            time, and user id when available. These logs are used to investigate and fix problems.
        </p>

        <h2>Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
            Account and training data are kept while your account exists. Password reset tokens
            expire and are invalidated after use.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
            For privacy questions or account data requests, contact the project owner at:
            <a href="mailto:silrada.soft@gmail.com">silrada.soft@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
    </section>
</main>
